; A trailing year of merchants, one of each shape the leaderboard has
; to tell apart: a supermarket charging every month, an airline
; charging once for more, a subscription charging every month for
; little, a corner store crossing two categories, a purchase that came
; back in full, and money that names nobody at all.
option "title" "Payees"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2025-01-01 open Assets:Checking          USD
2025-01-01 open Assets:Savings           USD
2025-01-01 open Equity:Opening           USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Travel          USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries  USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Fun:Streaming   USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Household       USD
2025-01-01 open Expenses:Misc            USD

2025-01-02 * "Opening balance"
  Assets:Checking  100000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening

