  Expenses:Travel          3000.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

; Two categories from one name.
2025-11-05 * "Corner Store" "Dinner and a mop"
  Expenses:Food:Groceries  180.00 USD
  Expenses:Household       120.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-02-05 * "Corner Store" "Dinner"
  Expenses:Food:Groceries  200.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

; Bought and returned: it cost nothing, so it ranks nowhere.
2025-09-10 * "Gadget Shop" "A thing"
  Expenses:Household       400.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2025-10-10 * "Gadget Shop" "Returned"
